# Implementation Plan - Enhanced Tool Stack

## Goal Description
Enhance the Deep Agent with a comprehensive tool stack to support research, code execution, file operations, git operations, database interaction, and MCP integration. This will transform the agent into a "MAS Ecosystem Builder".

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Security Risk**: Enabling code execution (`PythonREPL`) and file system access (`FileManagementToolkit`) poses significant security risks. Ensure the agent is running in a sandboxed environment or that the user is aware of the risks.

> [!WARNING]
> **Dependencies**: Some tools may require additional packages (e.g., `duckduckgo-search`, `wikipedia`, `gitpython`).

## Proposed Changes

### Dependencies
- Install `langchain_experimental` (for PythonREPLTool).
- Install `duckduckgo-search` or `tavily-python` (for search).
- Install `wikipedia` (for research).
- Install `gitpython` (for GitOps).

### [agent.py](file:///adapt/platform/novaops/frameworks/lang/deepagents-quickstarts/memory_agent/agent.py)
- Import and initialize new tools.
- Add tools to the [create_react_agent](file:///adapt/platform/novaops/frameworks/lang/langgraph/libs/prebuilt/langgraph/prebuilt/chat_agent_executor.py#269-992) call.
- Update system prompt to make the agent aware of its new capabilities.

